Memory Ledger — extracted local additions, 2026.

MemPalace (https://github.com/MemPalace/mempalace) is the upstream project around
which the shared memory journal and Python integration were developed.
This export does not include the complete upstream distribution.
The fact-lineage implementation was extracted from the author's LLM Wiki app.

Extraction changes:
- The workspace runtime policy was replaced by a minimal standalone policy.
- The Wiki bridge's default local module path now points into this repository.
- Tests use standalone module paths and synthetic temporary databases.
- Only three standard-library Node/Python contract cases were selected from
  the broader production integration suite.

No user databases, original documents, personal photos, authenticated routes,
credentials, runtime logs, model files or chat transcripts are distributed.
